{"version":1,"content":"\n\n<p><em><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/subscription/?utm_source=website&amp;utm_medium=article&amp;utm_campaign=subscription\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱／贊助／購物</a>，支持《法庭線》</em><em>報道香港，記錄香港。</em></p>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>Podcast</strong></h5>\n<p>一周法庭線報</p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>影片</strong></h5>\n<p>蔡天鳳碎屍案　譚家父子供詞整合　譚方駿如何發現妻子失蹤？與鄺家關係如何？ </p>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>法律101</strong></h5>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e6%b3%95%e5%be%8b101-%e5%85%92%e7%ab%a5%e7%8a%af%e6%b3%95%e4%be%bf%e6%af%8b%e9%a0%88%e8%b2%a0%e6%b3%95%e5%be%8b%e8%b2%ac%e4%bb%bb%e5%97%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"法律101｜兒童犯法，便毋須負法律責任嗎？\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/child101_%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E5%8D%80%E5%9F%9F-1-%E8%A4%87%E6%9C%AC-6-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>上周焦點</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>宏福苑大火聽證會</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e8%81%bd%e8%ad%89%e6%9c%83-%e7%8d%a8%e5%a7%94%e6%9c%83%e4%bb%8a%e5%90%91%e7%89%b9%e9%a6%96%e6%8f%90%e4%ba%a4%e5%a0%b1%e5%91%8a-%e5%85%ad%e8%bc%aa%e8%81%bd%e8%ad%89%e6%9c%83/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"宏福苑聽證會｜獨委會今向特首提交報告　李家超：短期內公布如何追責\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261022-WIT-01-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91%e8%81%bd%e8%ad%89%e6%9c%83%e6%95%b4%e5%90%88-%e9%81%ad%e6%96%a5%e9%9b%86%e9%ab%94%e5%80%9f%e5%90%8d-%e6%a9%a1%e7%9a%ae%e5%9c%96%e7%ab%a0-%e7%b0%bd%e5%90%8d%e6%a9%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"宏福 聽證會 整合\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/unnamed-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>王岸然案</strong></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"王岸然案\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0287_03_link_02-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%8e%8b%e5%b2%b8%e7%84%b6%e6%a1%88day7-%e7%8e%8b%e8%b3%aa%e7%96%91%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%89%e7%b4%84%e8%ab%87%e7%9c%be%e6%89%80%e5%91%a8%e7%9f%a5-%e4%b8%8d%e5%b1%ac%e6%8a%ab%e9%9c%b2%e8%aa%bf%e6%9f%a5/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day7｜王質疑國安約談眾所周知　不屬「披露」調查　官裁表證成立</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%8e%8b%e5%b2%b8%e7%84%b6%e6%a1%88day8-%e7%8e%8b%e8%87%aa%e8%be%af%e7%a8%b1%e8%ad%a6%e6%9c%aa%e7%ab%8b%e6%a1%88%e8%aa%bf%e6%9f%a5%e6%af%8b%e9%a0%88%e4%bf%9d%e5%af%86-%e8%b3%aa%e7%96%91%e8%ab%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day8｜王自辯稱警未立案調查毋須保密　質疑談論國安後被起訴「報復意味重」</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%8e%8b%e5%b2%b8%e7%84%b6%e6%a1%88day9-%e5%bd%b1%e7%89%87%e5%b0%81%e9%9d%a2%e7%94%a8%e6%bb%85%e5%85%b1%e5%ad%97%e7%9c%bc-%e7%8e%8b%e8%be%af%e7%a8%b1%e6%85%a3%e7%94%a8%e6%9c%89%e5%99%b1%e9%a0%ad/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day9｜影片封面用「滅共」字眼　王辯稱慣用有噱頭用字　質疑無政治術語受禁</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%8e%8b%e5%b2%b8%e7%84%b6%e6%a1%88day10%e7%8e%8b%e8%be%af%e7%a8%b1%e5%b7%bf%e6%b0%91%e5%87%ba%e6%96%bc%e4%ba%ba%e6%80%a7%e8%87%aa%e7%99%bc%e6%94%af%e6%8f%b4%e5%ae%8f%e7%a6%8f%e8%8b%91-%e4%b8%8d/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day10｜王辯稱巿民出於人性自發支援宏福苑　不涉政治動員、搞革命</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>蔡天鳳案</strong></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"蔡天鳳\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/0301_01_content_01-copy-2-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>蔡天鳳</figcaption></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day19-%e5%bb%9a%e5%85%b7%e5%ba%97%e5%93%a1%e7%99%bd%e9%ab%ae%e7%94%b7%e5%95%8f%e5%8c%96%e9%aa%a8%e6%a9%9f%e6%98%af%e5%90%a6%e5%8f%af%e7%a2%8e%e9%aa%a8-%e6%9c%89/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day19｜廚具店員：白髮男問「化骨機」是否可碎骨　有另一男同行</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day20-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%9d%91%e5%b1%8b%e6%a8%93%e4%b8%8a%e4%bd%8f%e6%88%b6%e4%b8%8b%e5%8d%88%e8%81%9e%e9%9b%bb%e9%8b%b8%e8%81%b2-%e6%99%9a%e6%9c%89%e9%9d%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day20｜龍尾村屋樓上住戶：下午聞電鋸聲　晚有青紅蘿蔔湯氣味</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day21-%e5%b0%88%e5%ae%b6%e9%81%ba%e9%aa%b8%e9%8b%b8%e7%97%95%e6%88%96%e7%94%b1%e9%9b%bb%e9%8b%b8%e9%80%a0%e6%88%90-%e9%be%8d%e5%b0%be%e6%a5%ad%e4%b8%bb%e9%84%ba/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day21｜專家：遺骸鋸痕或由電鋸造成　龍尾業主：鄺球問屋內有否CCTV</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day22-%e6%b3%95%e5%ba%ad%e8%99%95%e7%90%86%e6%b3%95%e5%be%8b%e7%88%ad%e8%ad%b0-%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%9c%98%e9%81%bf%e5%b8%ad-%e5%82%b3%e5%aa%92%e4%b8%8d%e5%be%97/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day22｜法庭處理法律爭議　陪審團避席　傳媒不得報道</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>涉詐騙提早領MPF　保險代理罪成還押</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e7%a7%bb%e8%8b%b1%e6%b8%af%e4%ba%ba%e8%88%87%e4%bf%9d%e9%9a%aa%e4%bb%a3%e7%90%86%e8%a2%ab%e6%8c%87%e8%a9%90%e9%a8%99%e6%8f%90%e6%97%a9%e9%a0%98mpf-%e4%bb%a3%e7%90%866%e7%bd%aa%e6%88%90%e9%82%84/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"區域法院 地院 區院\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2026-03-04-04-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>膳心小館雪櫃阻走火通道罪成　提上訴</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%86%b3%e5%bf%83%e5%b0%8f%e9%a4%a8%e8%a2%ab%e6%8c%87%e9%9b%aa%e6%ab%83%e9%98%bb%e5%a1%9e%e8%b5%b0%e7%81%ab%e9%80%9a%e9%81%93%e8%a3%81%e7%b